'''The Happy Lucky Temple''' (ハッピーラッキー寺院, ''Happī Rakkī Jiin'', '''Happy Lucky Temple''') is the 31st sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 80th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. Each stage in this sub-chapter focuses on enemies with different [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Difficulty==
A challenging sub-chapter at the very least and can be considered one of the hardest up to this point. Since all of these stages are based on status effects, owning units with immunity to such effects is what makes the difference, although it's not mandatory either. [[The Belated Priest]] and [[Adventurer's Journal]] are the most difficult.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

