==Trivia==
*These stages are status effect-themed. [[Pilgrim Agitators]], for example, only spawns enemies that cause knockback, while the others, in order, are based on: Slow, Weaken, Freeze, Warp and Toxic. The only enemy to not match the theme of their stage is [[Youcan]] in [[Chapel Transfer]], who cannot Warp cats.
**[[The Belated Priest]]'s name may hint at how all of the stage's enemies can slow cats, as slowness leads to belatedness.
**Chapel Transfer's name may hint at how most of the stage's enemies can Warp cats, as one definition of ''transfer'' is "move from one place to another". "Chapel" may also allude to the only enemy without Warp, Youcan, as chapels are places of worship and prayer and Youcan is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]].

